'''The Loch Emperor''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''The Loch Emperor''' can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]]. It requires {{Skill|Fishing|20}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''The Loch Emperor''' is {{Green|100}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|1%|1|100|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase its weight:

