== Trivia ==
* If the player brings a '''Loch Emperor''' using [[Necromancy]] to {{NPCSprite|Jake}} in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}, they sell a {{Item|Golden Ball}} for a limited time. It can be purchased from his shop for {{c|1,000,000}}.
** Capturing a '''Loch Emperor'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s soul will be displayed as '''The Emperor''' {{Lv|122}}.
* There was a bug with the {{Item|Ink Wand}}'s ability {{AN|Ink Bomb}} and the {{ID|Explosive Bow;Explosive Bow's}} explosive arrows, where if the '''Loch Emperor''' is killed by either of them, it could drop multiple {{Item|Emperor's Skull}}s and have a higher drop chance of rare items.
**This was due to the '''Loch Emperor''' being technically two mobs. The abilities killed both of them at once, causing double drops. This was fixed in the Community Update, patch 0.9.
<!--* '''The Loch Emperor''' targets other players if it has been hit by another player. If all other players that have damaged it are killed, it targets its summoner.-->
* The {{Ench|Blessing VI}} Enchantment Book drop was bugged from the '''Loch Emperor's''' loot table for a very long time until it was finally added with the [[Crimson Isle]] update.
* The '''Loch Emperor's''' previous [[Bestiary]] description implied the existence of at least seven seas, despite there currently being none.

